Axn::Extras::Strategies::Client registration
  registers the strategy in a process that has not loaded faraday
  resolves `use :client` when axn was loaded before faraday
  re-raises a LoadError that names a file other than faraday
  when faraday cannot be loaded
    raises at declaration, naming the gem to add
    still registers the strategy, so the failure names the missing gem rather than the strategy

Axn::Extras::Strategies::Client
  .configure
    with default configuration
      creates a client method with default name
      sets default headers
    with custom name
      creates a client method with custom name
      uses custom name in user agent
    with custom user_agent
      uses provided user agent
    with prepend_config
      calls prepend_config before default middleware
    with debug option
      enables logger middleware when debug is true
      does not enable logger middleware when debug is false
    with configuration block
      calls the block with the connection
    with callable options
      hydrates callable options
    with Faraday connection options
      passes options to Faraday.new
    memoization
      memoizes the client instance
    error handling
      raises error if client name is already taken
    with error_handler
      injects ErrorHandlerMiddleware when error_handler is provided
      does not inject ErrorHandlerMiddleware when error_handler is nil
      does not inject ErrorHandlerMiddleware when error_handler is not provided

